{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16740","headline":"悼孩子 · 于鹄","name":"悼孩子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年长始一男，心亦颇自娱。\n生来岁未周，奄然却归无。\n裸送不以衣，瘗埋於中衢。\n乳母抱出门，所生亦随呼。\n婴孩无哭仪，礼经不可踰。\n亲戚相问时，抑悲空叹吁。\n襁褓在旧牀，每见立踟蹰。\n静思益伤情，畏老爲独夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}